Description: static wlroots for treeland - development files
 wlroots 0.20.2 built as a static library (libdde-wlroots.a), with the
 public headers, the wlroots-private protocol XMLs and the dde-wlroots
 pkg-config metadata that waylib and treeland need at build time.
 .
 The archive is linked into the consumers' own shared objects, so no package
 from this source is needed at runtime.
